{"q":"100","t":"Same Tree","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the roots of two binary trees <code>p</code> and <code>q</code>, write a function to check if they are the same or not.</p>\n\n<p>Two binary trees are considered the same if they are structurally identical, and the nodes have the same value.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/709d6793eaf76f21.jpg\" style=\"width: 622px; height: 182px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> p = [1,2,3], q = [1,2,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/b74a0a4bb93cd0f5.jpg\" style=\"width: 382px; height: 182px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> p = [1,2], q = [1,null,2]\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/047097ea92eb72ab.jpg\" style=\"width: 622px; height: 182px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> p = [1,2,1], q = [1,1,2]\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in both trees is in the range <code>[0, 100]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"isSameTree\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"p\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"q\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Breadth-First Search","slug":"breadth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"}],"s":[],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Apple","apple"],["SAP","sap"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",4],["Amazon","amazon",4],["Meta","facebook",3],["Microsoft","microsoft",2],["tcs","tcs",2]],"b":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"m":[["LinkedIn","linkedin",3],["Apple","apple",3],["SAP","sap",2]]}}